From c13b2bce97a22b0ee5d81a633f5d6bf05941f461 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Mkwambe <eddy@mpingo.ai>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 06:41:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(league): classroom league rendering, teacher/athlete
 dashboard wiring
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- /league/[id]: fetch league_advancement for classroom leagues and pass
  advancementInfo (targetLeagueName + slotsAllocated) to LeagueDashboard
- LeagueDashboard: full rewrite with classroom-aware rendering
  - levelIcon() returns 🏫 for classroom, 🏙️ for district, etc.
  - AdvancementBanner component shows 'Top N advance to <School League>'
    for classroom-level leagues only
  - BracketMatchCard: isClassroom prop renders first-name-only in slots
  - StandingsTable: isClassroom renders first names + advancement cut-line
    drawn after the last advancing slot
  - SeasonTimeline: Championship Path highlights current level dynamically
    (Classroom → School → District → Regional → State → National)
- Teacher dashboard: for each class card, look up its classroom league
  by school_id + level='classroom' + name match, and render a
  '🏫 View Classroom League →' link if found
- Athlete dashboard:
  - ELO query: removed .is('division_id', null) filter; now orders by
    games_played DESC so the ADV-division row is returned correctly
  - New classroomStanding query fetches rank/wins/losses/points from
    league_standings joined to leagues where level='classroom'
  - New Classroom League card shows rank, wins, losses, points with a
    'View Bracket →' link to /league/[id]
